<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>Stocks-Markets-Economic Times</title><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks</link><description><![CDATA[Stock Market News: Latest Stock news and updates on The Economic Times. Find Stock Market Live Updates, BSE, NSE Top Gainers, Losers and more.]]> </description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 03:45:05 +0530</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/2146842.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) 2026 Bennett Coleman and Co. Ltd, http://info.indiatimes.com/terms/tou.html</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>Economic Times</title><url>https://img.etimg.com/thumb/msid-76939477,width-600,height-60/economictimes.jpg</url><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks</link></image><item><title><![CDATA[Sebi proposes limiting tenure of chief executives, independent directors at exchanges]]> </title><description><![CDATA[India's Securities and Exchange Board is proposing crucial adjustments to governance norms affecting market institutions. Key suggestions include lowering the age threshold for public interest directors from 75 to 70 years, instituting a maximum of two three-year terms for directors, and restricting managing directors to an eight-year tenure. Current executives can finish their ongoing terms despite these proposed changes. SEBI is seeking public feedback on these recommendations by December 11.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/sebi-proposes-limiting-tenure-of-chief-executives-independent-directors-at-exchanges/articleshow/136031465.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136031465,imgsize-168964.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/sebi-proposes-limiting-tenure-of-chief-executives-independent-directors-at-exchanges/articleshow/136031465.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:39:36 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sebi plans consultation paper to remove FPI constraints absent in other markets]]> </title><description><![CDATA[SEBI is set to release a consultation paper aimed at simplifying regulations for foreign portfolio investors. The goal is to eliminate certain compliance restrictions to enhance India's appeal to global investors. SEBI also plans to expedite the onboarding process, targeting completion in just five business days. Additionally, KYC review cycles for applicable FPIs will be extended, reducing repetitive compliance activities.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/sebi-plans-consultation-paper-to-remove-fpi-constraints-absent-in-other-markets/articleshow/136020808.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136020808,imgsize-41262.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/sebi-plans-consultation-paper-to-remove-fpi-constraints-absent-in-other-markets/articleshow/136020808.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 14:49:53 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian finance hub eyes dual share model to kickstart public offers: Report]]> </title><description><![CDATA[Indian regulators are currently assessing a new proposal that would allow companies to introduce dual-class shares for listings in both domestic markets and GIFT City. This initiative seeks to invigorate equity market activity in GIFT City, which has faced challenges regarding limited primary market participation. One class of shares would be traded in rupees, while the other would be dollar-denominated, granting foreign investors easier access alongside reduced tax implications.]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/indian-finance-hub-eyes-dual-share-model-to-kickstart-public-offers-report/articleshow/136017941.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136017941,imgsize-147888.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/indian-finance-hub-eyes-dual-share-model-to-kickstart-public-offers-report/articleshow/136017941.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 13:02:59 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sun Pharma Share Price Live Updates: Sun Pharma Stock Price History]]> </title><description><![CDATA[]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/sun-pharma-stock-price-livestock-price-today-live-updates-20-nov-2026/liveblog/136016959.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136016959,imgsize-72289.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/sun-pharma-stock-price-livestock-price-today-live-updates-20-nov-2026/liveblog/136016959.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:19:25 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[M&amp;M Share Price Live Updates: M&amp;M Stock Price History]]> </title><description><![CDATA[]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/mm-share-price-today-live-20-nov-2026/liveblog/136016893.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136016893,imgsize-4428.cms" length="0"/><guid>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/mm-share-price-today-live-20-nov-2026/liveblog/136016893.cms</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:17:54 +0530</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Eicher Motors Share Price Live Updates: Eicher Motors Stock Price History]]> </title><description><![CDATA[]]> </description><link>https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/stock-liveblog/eicher-motors-share-price-live-20-nov-2026/liveblog/136016875.cms</link><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-136016875,imgsize-3258.cms" length="0